  <div class="pd-sec"><h2>About Laxmi Shrushti</h2><p>Laxmi Shrusti is a Residential Project Developed by the Laxmi Group. It is located at Goregaon West. Goregaon West enjoys excellent connectivity to various parts of Mumbai. It is well-connected to the Western Express Highway, which provides easy access to both the northern and southern parts of the city. It offers a wide range of social amenities, including schools, colleges, hospitals, shopping malls, restaurants, and entertainment centers. Residents have access to reputed educational institutions and healthcare facilities in the area. It is a single tower of 23 storey tower. Modern living spaces with Uninterrupted views. Amenities include Double heighted spacious air-conditioned lobby with Reception, Terrace with open garden, yoga space, jogging track etc, Solar Panel, Video Door Phones with intercom facility. senior citizen area on terrace level, and many more.</p></div>
  
  

  
  <div class="pd-sec"><h2>Amenities</h2><div class="pd-amen">
    <span>💧 Electrical Meter Room, Sub-Station, Receiving Station</span><span>🔥 Fire Protection And Fire Safety Requirements</span><span>✅ Sewerage (Chamber, Lines, Septic Tank , STP)</span><span>✅ Storm Water Drains</span><span>💧 Water Conservation, Rain water Harvesting</span><span>✅ Water Supply</span><span>💧 Water conservation /Rain water harvesting</span>
  </div></div>
  

  

  

  
  

  


